cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and Chang Cheng's dissertation when using this package."
type: software
title: "Supervised NMF for Classification"
version: 0.1.0a0
repository-code: "https://github.com/cheng338/supervised-nmf"
authors:
  - family-names: Cheng
    given-names: Chang
abstract: >-
  Supervised nonnegative matrix factorization for binary classification, using
  feature screening, nonnegative factorization and nearest-neighbor prediction.
  Implements Chapter 7 of Chang Cheng's dissertation, Overcoming the Curses of
  Dimensionality and Kernelization: Scalable DWD and Supervised NMF, from the
  original simulation and CelebA experiment scripts.

